OL,3,GNEWSATwo bailed in murder investigation
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo people arrested in connection with
OL,6,Fthe murder of a man whose body was
OL,7,Ffound in a property have been released
OL,8,Fon bail.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said it
OL,11,Fbelieved the man, in his 50s, died
OL,12,Fseveral days before his body was
OL,13,Fdiscovered.
OL,15,FOfficers went to the address on High
OL,16,FStreet in Burton Latimer on Wednesday
OL,17,Fafternoon after receiving a "concern
OL,18,Ffor welfare" call.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
