OL,3,GNEWSATwo bailed in murder investigation
OL,4,
OL,5,FA 38-year-old woman and a man, aged 53,
OL,6,Fwho were arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fassisting an offender have been
OL,8,Freleased on police bail. Three men
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of murder
OL,10,Fremained in custody, police said.
